---
// The MaizeKit homepage. A product page, separate from the Starlight docs under /docs/.
const repo = 'https://github.com/MaizeKit/MaizeKit';
const addMaze = `${repo}/issues/new?template=add-maze.yml`;
const live = '/m/moore-family-farm/';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>MaizeKit</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Turn a photo of a corn maze map into a phone app that shows where you are and the way out.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://maizekit.github.io/">
  <meta property="og:title" content="MaizeKit">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Turn a photo of a corn maze map into a phone app that shows where you are and the way out.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://maizekit.github.io/brand/og.png">
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <link rel="icon" href="/brand/maizekit-favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/brand/maizekit-icon-512.png">
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/brand/maizekit-favicon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20">MaizeKit</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/docs/">Docs</a>
        <a href={repo}>GitHub</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href={live}>Try it</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <img class="hero-icon" src="/brand/maizekit-icon.svg" alt="" width="76" height="76">
      <h1>Find your way out.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Turn a photo of a corn maze map into a phone app that shows where you are and the way out.</p>
      <div class="ctas">
        <a class="btn" href={live}>Try a live maze</a>
        <a class="more" href="/docs/">Get started</a>
      </div>
      <div class="phone">
        <div class="screen">
          <i class="island"></i>
          <img src="/brand/app-phone.jpg" alt="MaizeKit on an iPhone: a corn maze on satellite imagery, a blue dot and a blue route to the exit, 408 m away" width="1000" height="2166">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dark">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>From the sign<br>to your phone.</h2>
      <p class="sub">Most corn mazes post a map at the entrance. That photo is all it takes.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <div class="frame"><img src="/brand/sign-photo.jpg" alt="The America 250 maze map on a sign at the entrance to Moore Family Farm's corn maze" width="900" height="1173" loading="lazy"></div>
          <b>1</b><h3>Photograph the map.</h3><p>The sign at the entrance, or an aerial shot.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="frame"><img src="/brand/maze-overlay.webp" alt="The maze map straightened and fitted to the shape of the field" width="1408" height="1248" loading="lazy"></div>
          <b>2</b><h3>Line it up.</h3><p>Fitted to the real field on satellite imagery, every path found.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="frame"><img src="/brand/tile-route.jpg" alt="A blue route through the maze from a blue dot to the exit" width="900" height="540" loading="lazy"></div>
          <b>3</b><h3>Walk out.</h3><p>Your dot, and the way to the exit from wherever you are.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="science">
      <p class="eyebrow">Under the hood</p>
      <h2>It learns what corn<br>looks like.</h2>
      <p class="sub">Every map is different: painted signs, drone shots, sun and shadow. So MaizeKit reads each one on its own terms.</p>
      <div class="sci">
        <figure class="sci-fig">
          <img src="/brand/paths-moore.png" alt="Moore Family Farm's maze as MaizeKit sees it: every path in gold, brighter toward the middle of each path" width="1240" height="980" loading="lazy">
          <figcaption>Moore Family Farm, as the router sees it. Brighter is further from the corn.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <ol class="sci-steps">
          <li><b>Learn the corn.</b> Most of a maze is corn, so the typical colour inside the field <em>is</em> the corn colour.</li>
          <li><b>Measure the difference.</b> Every pixel gets a distance from that colour. Paths stand out, lighter or darker.</li>
          <li><b>Split three ways.</b> Corn, light paths, dark paths: a three-class version of Otsu's method finds the cut-offs.</li>
          <li><b>Ignore the gaps.</b> Anything narrower than 1.2&nbsp;m, the space between corn rows, isn't a path.</li>
          <li><b>Check it connects.</b> If under 90% of the paths reach the exit, the maze page tells visitors some routes may be missing.</li>
          <li><b>Route down the middle.</b> Walking distance from the exit is worked out once, favouring the centre of each path, so the way out is instant from anywhere.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <p class="sci-note">Steps 1–4 are for aerial photos. Painted signs like Moore's use a simpler colour rule. <a href="/docs/reference/">See the code</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="features">
      <h2>Everything you need.<br><span>Nothing you don't.</span></h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="tile wide media">
          <img src="/brand/tile-route.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="540" loading="lazy">
          <div class="cap"><h3>You are here.</h3><p>A blue dot on the maze, from your phone's GPS.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 38V24h14V10h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M32 4l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="10" cy="38" r="5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          <h3>The way out.</h3>
          <p>A route along the real paths to the exit, from wherever you're standing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="4" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M24 3v8M24 37v8M3 24h8M37 24h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          <h3>Fix my spot.</h3>
          <p>GPS a row off? Tap where you really are.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 30c6-10 10-10 16 0s10 10 16 0 6-6 8-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".3"/><path d="M4 20h40" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          <h3>Steady.</h3>
          <p>The route holds through GPS wobble instead of jumping rows.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile qr">
          <img src="/brand/qr-moore.svg" alt="QR code for the Moore Family Farm maze" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy">
          <h3>Scan to start.</h3>
          <p>Every maze gets a printable entrance sign with a QR code.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile full accent">
          <h3>Private by design.</h3>
          <p>No server. No accounts. Your location never leaves your phone.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="close">
      <h2>Free for every farm.</h2>
      <p class="sub">Send us a photo of your maze map and your address. We'll set it up and send you the link.</p>
      <div class="ctas">
        <a class="btn" href={addMaze}>Add your maze</a>
        <a class="more" href={repo}>View on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="foot">
      <p>Examples: <a href={live}>Moore Family Farm</a>, Groton, NY, and <a href="/m/richardson-adventure-farm/">Richardson Adventure Farm</a>, Spring Grove, IL, both 2026. Built from the maps the farms post publicly; farms shown here aren't affiliated with MaizeKit and haven't endorsed these pages. <a href={addMaze}>Ask for changes or removal.</a></p>
      <p>MIT licensed. Maps drawn with <a href="https://maplibre.org/">MapLibre GL JS</a>. Satellite imagery © Esri.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  /* Always dark. */
  :root {
    --text: #f5f5f7;
    --muted: #a1a1a6;
    --bg: #000000;
    --soft: #101012;
    --gold: #f5a11a;
    --gold-deep: #e07b0a;
    --link: #2997ff;
    --link-hover: #47a6ff;
    --tile: #1c1c1e;
    --nav: rgba(22, 22, 23, 0.8);
    --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    --footer-line: #2c2c2e;
    --qr-pad: #ffffff;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Display", "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  a { color: var(--link); text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

  .nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
    background: var(--nav);
    backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-inner { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 22px; height: 48px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; }
  .brand:hover { text-decoration: none; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; font-size: 13px; }
  .nav-links a { color: var(--text); opacity: 0.8; }
  .nav-links a.nav-cta { opacity: 1; background: var(--link); color: #fff; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 980px; }
  .nav-links a.nav-cta:hover { text-decoration: none; background: var(--link-hover); }

  section { padding: 96px 22px; text-align: center; }
  h1, h2 { margin: 0 auto; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em; text-wrap: balance; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 96px); line-height: 1.02; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px); line-height: 1.05; }
  .lede, .sub { text-wrap: balance; max-width: 640px; margin: 20px auto 0; font-size: clamp(19px, 2.4vw, 24px); line-height: 1.35; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gold); }

  .hero { padding-top: 72px; padding-bottom: 0; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .hero-icon { margin: 0 auto 24px; width: 76px; height: 76px; filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 10px rgba(224, 123, 10, 0.22)); }
  .ctas { display: flex; gap: 28px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 32px; font-size: 17px; }
  .btn { background: var(--link); color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 980px; font-weight: 500; }
  .btn:hover { background: var(--link-hover); text-decoration: none; }
  .more::after { content: " ›"; }

  .phone {
    width: min(340px, 78vw);
    margin: 64px auto -140px;
    padding: 11px;
    border-radius: 58px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #3a3a3c, #1d1d1f 40%, #2c2c2e);
    box-shadow: 0 50px 100px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }
  .screen { position: relative; border-radius: 47px; overflow: hidden; background: #8a8f6d; }
  /* Dynamic Island over a status-bar gap, so the app's top card sits below it like on a real iPhone. */
  .screen { padding-top: 44px; }
  .island { position: absolute; top: 11px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 92px; height: 27px; border-radius: 20px; background: #000; }

  .dark { background: #0b0b0c; color: #f5f5f7; padding-top: 200px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }

  .dark .sub { color: #a1a1a6; }
  .steps { list-style: none; padding: 0; max-width: 980px; margin: 64px auto 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; text-align: left; }
  .frame { aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; background: #1d1d1f; display: grid; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .frame img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .steps li:nth-child(2) .frame img { object-fit: contain; padding: 18px; }
  .steps b { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gold); color: #000; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .steps h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .steps p { margin: 0; color: #a1a1a6; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.4; }

  .science { background: var(--bg); }
  .sci { max-width: 980px; margin: 56px auto 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; text-align: left; }
  .sci-fig { margin: 0; background: #0b0b0c; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 28px; padding: 28px; }
  .sci-fig figcaption { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; }
  .sci-steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: s; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 18px; }
  .sci-steps li { counter-increment: s; position: relative; padding-left: 44px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--muted); }
  .sci-steps li::before { content: counter(s); position: absolute; left: 0; top: 1px; width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--tile); color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .sci-steps b { color: var(--text); }
  .sci-steps em { color: var(--text); font-style: normal; }
  .sci-note { margin: 36px auto 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
  .features { background: var(--soft); }
  .features h2 span { color: var(--muted); }
  .grid { max-width: 980px; margin: 56px auto 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; text-align: left; }
  .tile { background: var(--tile); border-radius: 28px; padding: 36px 32px; min-height: 220px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .tile.wide { grid-column: span 2; }
  .tile.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; min-height: 180px; }
  .tile.media { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; position: relative; min-height: 300px; color: #fff; }
  .tile.media img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .tile.media .cap { position: relative; margin-top: auto; padding: 80px 32px 30px; background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75)); }
  .tile.media p { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82); }
  .tile.qr img { width: 88px; height: 88px; margin-bottom: 28px; background: var(--qr-pad); padding: 0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px var(--qr-pad); }
  .glyph { width: 56px; height: 56px; color: var(--link); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .tile.accent { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd24a, var(--gold-deep)); color: #2b1600; }
  .tile.accent p { color: rgba(43, 22, 0, 0.8); }
  .tile h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .tile p { margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--muted); }

  .close { padding-bottom: 120px; }

  footer { background: var(--soft); border-top: 1px solid var(--footer-line); }
  .foot { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 22px 32px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--muted); }
  .foot p { margin: 6px 0; }

  @media (max-width: 734px) {
    section { padding: 72px 20px; }
    .dark { padding-top: 180px; }
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tile.wide, .tile.full { grid-column: auto; }
    .tile { min-height: 0; padding: 28px 24px; }
    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 420px; gap: 44px; }
    .sci { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
    .nav-links { gap: 16px; }
  }
</style>
